# Frontend environment variables
#
# As built, the frontend needs NONE. It's a thin client that talks only to the backend over relative
# /api/* calls — same-origin in production (Express serves the built app), and Vite proxies /api to
# http://localhost:3000 in dev (see vite.config.ts). The browser never holds a database key: all
# Supabase access is server-side through the service_role key on the backend.
#
# Only add a var here if you deploy the frontend on a DIFFERENT origin than the API — then introduce a
# VITE_API_BASE_URL and prefix the fetch() calls with it.
